WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.712
JAMIE: The thing I find most
interesting is what

00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:05.424
JAMIE: "Terra" as a product tier
signals about how

00:00:05.424 --> 00:00:08.136
JAMIE: OpenAI reads the market.
They're not pretending everyone

00:00:08.136 --> 00:00:10.849
JAMIE: needs the frontier model.
They're building a stack

00:00:10.849 --> 00:00:13.561
JAMIE: — frontier for the hardest
problems, Terra for

00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:16.273
JAMIE: volume professional work.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.851
ALEX: Which is how mature
technology markets usually work.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.319
ALEX: You don't buy a sports car
to commute.

00:00:21.384 --> 00:00:23.090
RUFUS: Unless you're making a
point.

00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:24.759
JAMIE: About what?

00:00:24.844 --> 00:00:26.373
RUFUS: About the commute.
